Package: abcclock
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, curl
Description: Qt5 hover desktop clock
 A frameless, always-on-top desktop clock overlay: analog dial, weekday,
 date, three city timezones and three city weather lines.
 It positions itself (override-redirect) at the top right of the screen,
 runs on X11 and on XWayland in Wayland sessions, and provides a
 StatusNotifierItem tray menu (show/hide, settings, run-at-login, quit).
